<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Roadmap IA Engineer - Style UML</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #f9fafb;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #222;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .uml-vertical {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .uml-node {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #00bfa6;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #333;
      min-width: 250px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .uml-line::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 100%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 2px;
      height: 30px;
      background-color: #ccc;
    }

    .uml-node:last-child.uml-line::after {
      display: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .uml-node {
        min-width: auto;
        width: 90%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="title">Roadmap - AI Engineer (UML Style)</div>
    <div class="uml-vertical">
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Introduction à l'IA</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">AI vs ML</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Terminologie : AGI, LLM, RAG, Embeddings...</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Étude des modèles pré-entraînés</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Modèles OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Mistral</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Utilisation des APIs (Completion, Prompt, Fine-tuning)</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Comprendre les Tokens, Max Tokens, Pricing</div>
      <div class="uml-node uml-line">Sécurité de l'IA : Prompt Injection, Fairness</div>
      <div class="uml-node">Bonnes pratiques & veille technologique</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
